OL,3,GNEWSADance lessons cancelled after
OL,4,A'horrendous' break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dance studio in Leicester has been
OL,7,Fforced to cancel all its lessons for
OL,8,Fthe next month after a "horrendous"
OL,9,Fbreak-in.
OL,11,FWindows were broken and a number of
OL,12,Fitems stolen when the CDCA Academy in
OL,13,FDarker Street was burgled between 15:00
OL,14,Fand 20:30 GMT on 21 November.
OL,16,FMembers of the academy were performing
OL,17,Ftheir end-of-year show at the Peepul
OL,18,FCentre when the incident took place.
OL,19,FStudio manager Farida Kavde returned to
OL,20,Fthe academy after the show and said the
OL,21,Fscene was "just horrendous".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
