OL,3,GNEWSADance lessons cancelled after
OL,4,A'horrendous' break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police said a
OL,7,F45-year-old man was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of burglary and has been
OL,9,Freleased on bail pending further
OL,10,Finquiries.
